{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every tie positioned on the top side of the scene, there is a column of items arranged below it: a monitor is directly below the tie, a plate is located below the monitor, and a handbag is positioned below the plate. All four objects\u2014the tie, monitor, plate, and handbag\u2014are aligned vertically.",
